    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>比赛规则</>\n赛场使用<Highlight>玩家真实属性</>，<Highlight>装备、封印物、秘偶、人脉、非凡天赋系统效果</>均可生效。玩家将以战队形式进行比赛，每个战队内同途径玩家最多为两名。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>报名规则</>\n比赛报名开启后，玩家即可组建或加入战队，战队成员<Highlight>达到5名</>后即可报名。\n开启报名至锁定报名期间，战队队长可自由调整战队成员，成员也可自由离开战队，已报名战队若成员变动导致成员数量小于5名后将自动取消报名。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>锁定规则</>\n锁定报名期间，已报名战队可以进入准备场地，未报名战队仍可以进行报名操作，玩家也可以加入战队，但不可以主动离开或队长请离战队，已报名战队将不允许取消报名。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>对战规则</>\n比赛正式开始后，玩家需要<Highlight>停留在准备场地</>以保证正常进入比赛，擅自离开准备场地将导致无法正常参加比赛。\n小组赛阶段，每轮随机匹配对手进行单局比赛，共进行六轮，根据胜场数选出16支队伍晋级，胜场数相同会根据<Highlight>荣耀值决出晋级者（荣耀值参考击杀数、战斗时长）</>。\n小组赛结束后进入助力阶段，淘汰赛开始前根据<Highlight>助力值和荣耀值总和</>确定淘汰赛位次，淘汰赛开始后仍可进行助力，但不再影响淘汰赛位次。\n淘汰赛阶段将进行<Highlight>三局两胜</>来确定胜负，决赛将进行<Highlight>五局三胜</>决出冠军！"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Match Rules </>\n The arena uses <Highlight> player's real attributes </>, and the effects of <Highlight> equipment, Sealed Artifacts, marionettes, connections, and Beyonder talent systems </> are all effective. Players will compete as a team, with a maximum of two players of the same pathway per team. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Registration Rules </>\n Once match registration opens, players can form or join a team. Once a team <Highlight> reaches 5 members </>, they can register. \n From the opening of registration until it is locked, the team leader can freely adjust members, and members can freely leave. If a registered team's member count falls below 5 due to changes, registration will be automatically canceled. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Locking Rules </>\n During the registration lock period, registered teams can enter the preparation area. Unregistered teams can still register, and players can join teams, but they cannot leave or be removed by the leader. Registered teams cannot cancel their registration. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Battle Rules </>\n After the match officially begins, players must <Highlight> stay in the preparation area </> to ensure they enter the match normally; leaving the preparation area without authorization will result in being unable to participate. \n In the group stage, opponents are randomly matched for a single-game match. There are six rounds in total, and 16 teams are selected to advance based on wins. If wins are tied, <Highlight> Glory Value (based on kills and combat duration) </> will determine the advancer. \n After the group stage, the support phase begins. Before the knockout stage, the knockout bracket is determined based on the <Highlight> sum of support value and Glory Value </>. Support can still be given after the knockout stage begins, but it will no longer affect the bracket. \n The knockout stage will use a <Highlight> best-of-three </> format to determine the winner, and the final will use a <Highlight> best-of-five </> format to determine the champion!",
