    ["　　<InvDefault_HW>银雾森林迎来了今年的第一场雪，东边的雾气也越发浓厚，掉落了不少羽毛的戴莉在窝里冻得直发抖。枝头小小的巢穴无法抵御寒冷，顶上抖落的一坨雪将巢穴砸落下去，戴莉还没来得及发出叫声，就发现自己被温暖的灰色皮毛包裹——它落在了一只灰麋鹿的头顶。</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>“我察觉到这里有动物需要帮助，是你吗？”那只灰麋鹿这么说道。</>"] = "　　<InvDefault_HW> The Silver Mist Forest welcomed the first snow of the year, and the mist in the east grew even thicker. Daly, having lost many feathers, shivered in its nest from the cold. The tiny nest on the branch could not withstand the chill, and a clump of snow shaken from above knocked the nest down. Before Daly could even let out a cry, it found itself wrapped in warm, grey fur—it had landed on the head of a grey moose. </>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW> \"I sensed that an animal here needed help. Is it you?\" the grey moose said. </>",
